<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall further.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall further.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three-, six- and 12-month treasury bills fell by 0.06, 0.28 and 0.43 percentage points, respectively, at Wednesday's auction, the central bank said.</p>
<p>		  bids received   bids accepted   avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     1,912	     1,620	  12.72 (12.78)</p>
<p>    6 months     1,945		 750	  14.15 (14.43)</p>
<p>    12 months    2,196		 800	  14.57 (15.00)</p>
<p>    Total	  6,053	     3,170</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
